              {
                "text": "**Analyzing Grid Patterns**\n\nOkay, so I'm seeing orange backgrounds with scattered colored pixels on the grids. The output is fascinating: concentric squares! My current focus is figuring out what dictates the order of these rings. For example, in the 9x9 case, how does the center of the grid influence the ring formation?\n\n\n",
